-   ├─ /products/*       → search, detail, nutrition, unified merged view
-   ├─ /prices/*         → compare, history, latest
-   ├─ /basket/*         → calculate, nutrition, PDF export
-   ├─ /scan             → barcode → product + prices
-   └─ /agent/*          → intent detection → DB tools → LLM (Groq, via LiteLLM)
-   │
-   ▼
